# systemkit.abi -- the export table of SD:/lib/systemkit.so: "<slot> <symbol>", in the table's order.
# APPEND-ONLY (tools/libgen/libgen.py adds the new functions at the end): never move or remove a
# line -- programs built against an older table call the entries by their slot. The one edit allowed:
# a function RENAMED keeps its line, with its new symbol (a reserved virtual given a meaning).
# The table's version is its number of entries.
